tact_route, [contact_patch, mesa, bonding_pad], 15.0.\n- adjacency {component_a, component_b, tolerance?} \u2014 fraction of component_a shapes near component_b (default tolerance 2.0).\n- solidity {component, threshold?, direction?} \u2014 shape solidity score vs threshold (default 0.5, below).\n- spacing {component_a, component_b?, min_distance?} \u2014 fraction of shape pairs meeting min distance (default: same component, 1.0).\n\nAll component / region / target_components values are keys in layer_map.",
